## Project purpose

Greenfield rebuild of the **Chairman Real Estate marketing landing** for international investors and high-net-worth buyers in Zanzibar.

- **Audience:** Investors, diaspora, luxury property buyers
- **Language:** English primary; Swahili v2
- **Geography:** Zanzibar, Tanzania

## Design style

Premium corporate portal: navy/gold, serif headlines, full-bleed hero photography, 14-section marketing narrative (not listings catalog as homepage).

